        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml A2-Peta-Power-Interest\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam rectangle {\n    RoundCorner 10\n}\n\ntitle PETA POWER / INTEREST STAKEHOLDER (MENDELOW)\ncaption Layanan Presensi Kuliah (Attendance Management - Kelompok I-5)\n\n&#39; Kuadran Atas (High Power)\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;KEEP SATISFIED&lt;/b&gt;\\n(Puaskan &amp; Pelihara)\\n&lt;i&gt;High Power / Low Interest&lt;/i&gt;\\n\\n• Auditor Mutu Internal UMI\\n• Tim Operasional Server\&quot; as KeepSatisfied #FFF3CD {\n}\n\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;MANAGE CLOSELY&lt;/b&gt;\\n(Kelola dengan Erat)\\n&lt;i&gt;High Power / High Interest&lt;/i&gt;\\n\\n• Staf Biro Akademik\\n• Dosen Pengampu\&quot; as ManageClosely #F8D7DA {\n}\n\n&#39; Kuadran Bawah (Low Power)\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;MONITOR&lt;/b&gt;\\n(Pantau / Minimum Effort)\\n&lt;i&gt;Low Power / Low Interest&lt;/i&gt;\\n\\n• Tim Pengembang (PDTI UMI)\&quot; as Monitor #E2E3E5 {\n}\n\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;KEEP INFORMED&lt;/b&gt;\\n(Beri Informasi / Komunikasi)\\n&lt;i&gt;Low Power / High Interest&lt;/i&gt;\\n\\n• Mahasiswa (Maba, Sem 3, Sem 5)\&quot; as KeepInformed #D1ECF1 {\n}\n\n&#39; Pengaturan Tata Letak (Grid 2x2)\nKeepSatisfied -right-&gt; ManageClosely :  Pengaruh Tinggi (Power ▲)\nKeepSatisfied -down-&gt; Monitor : Kepentingan Rendah\nManageClosely -down-&gt; KeepInformed : Kepentingan Tinggi\nMonitor -right-&gt; KeepInformed :  Pengaruh Rendah (Power ▼)\n\nnote left of KeepSatisfied\n  &lt;b&gt;Strategi Audit &amp; Stabilitas:&lt;/b&gt;\n  Sediakan log transparan dan \n  jaga ketersediaan server tanpa \n  membebani urusan teknis harian.\nend note\n\nnote right of ManageClosely\n  &lt;b&gt;Strategi Kolaborasi Erat:&lt;/b&gt;\n  Libatkan langsung pada aturan \n  bisnis presensi, alur approval, \n  dan format rekapitulasi data.\nend note\n\nnote left of Monitor\n  &lt;b&gt;Strategi Pemantauan:&lt;/b&gt;\n  Pantau metrik kualitatif kode, \n  review pull request, dan status \n  performa sistem berkala.\nend note\n\nnote right of KeepInformed\n  &lt;b&gt;Strategi Komunikasi Rutin:&lt;/b&gt;\n  Berikan panduan UI/UX maba, \n  notifikasi status presensi real-time, \n  dan kemudahan klaim kendala jaringan.\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="G-CvwgH6b0asnhwdJnc8-1">
